<doctext field_name="doctext">&lt;p&gt;Hi [predrag],&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;i&gt;data would changes probably two times a day&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;One way to do this would be with a [man://cron] job calling a Perl script that generates the charts twice a day and saves them as image files. Then, the web server would only have to serve up static files, without the need of calling a CGI script to get the images.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Regards,&lt;br&gt;-- Hauke D&lt;/p&gt;</doctext>
